   "step": "做法第 2 步",
   "fact": "Visibility.Hidden 隐藏但参与布局占位，Visibility.None 隐藏且不占位",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-appendix-enums.md，Visibility；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/enums.d.ts，Visibility",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "原因",
   "fact": "Compose Row 中不带 weight 的 fillMaxWidth 文本先测量，尾部 IconButton 只剩 0 宽约束、内容被裁掉，Android 上不绘制（Pixel 基线布局 dump 里没有这个节点）",
   "source": "卡里上机实测（case-72a54efb333474d03d1a，Pixel 基线布局 dump）",
   "kind": "卡里验证",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "原因 / 做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "父容器尺寸确定时，不设 layoutWeight 的子组件先占位，layoutWeight 大于 0 的子组件再从剩余空间按权重分配，分配时忽略自身的 width、height",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-universal-attributes-size.md，layoutWeight；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/common.d.ts，CommonMethod.layoutWeight",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 2 步",
   "fact": "clip 没有设置时不裁剪子组件超出本组件范围的部分；设为 true 后，超出部分被裁掉，也不响应绑定的手势",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-universal-attributes-sharp-clipping.md，clip；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/common.d.ts，CommonMethod.clip",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  }
